====''Black & White'' arc====
Three boxed sets were released for the {{MangaArc|Black & White}}, collecting [[List of Pokémon Black and White volumes|VIZ Media's mini-volumes]].

The first boxed set was released on October 2, 2012. It contains {{Vol|Pokémon Black and White|1}} through {{Vol|Pokémon Black and White|8}}. A special poster was included in the box. The ISBN for this boxed set is ISBN 9781421550053.

The second boxed set was released on September 2, 2014. It contains {{Vol|Pokémon Black and White|9}} through {{Vol|Pokémon Black and White|14}}. A special poster was included in the box. The ISBN for this boxed set is ISBN 9781421577746.

The third and final boxed set was released on September 1, 2015. It contains {{Vol|Pokémon Black and White|15}} through {{Vol|Pokémon Black and White|20}}. A special poster was included in the box. The ISBN for this boxed set is ISBN 9781421582771.

